	"description": "Would you like to look up German articles (der, die, das) and verb forms easily offline?\nThis add-on gives you several ways to do so:\n- Directly in your text editor: place the cursor within a word or select it, then press NVDA + Shift + Enter. The appropriate article for a noun is announced; for a verb, a new window opens with all its forms. You can perform the same action by left-clicking while holding NVDA + Ctrl. When using the mouse with a noun, a popup displays its article in a large font.\n- You can also look up nouns and verbs directly in the database: open the search window with NVDA + Ctrl + F5.",
